  "source": "harness/native_script_baseline.py PARAM_OPS + the pilots' VALUES",
  "note": "Written by tools/export_param_cases.py; regenerate after changing an op. ops use the Windows engine's vocabulary: tab / op=float|checkbox|combo|rowcombo / label (str or candidates, '^' anchors the row start) / group / value / field (index into a vertical stack of boxes) / below / target / current (the value a combo paints) / answer + dialog (a box the op must answer). 'combo' ops are located by the value they paint, 'rowcombo' ops by their row label. A port that cannot reach a row reports it; it never edits config."
